3. SCOPE - WHAT THIS LICENCE COVERS, AND WHAT IT DOES NOT

   3.1 COVERED SOFTWARE (included in this License)

   This License covers BOTH editions - UpinelAIOS-GGUF (the llama.cpp/GGUF
   edition) and UpinelAIOS-MLX (the MLX/MTPLX edition) - and all original
   material written for either of them by the Licensor, which is:

     (a) the shell entry points - install.sh, start.sh, stop.sh, restart.sh,
         status.sh, chat.sh and model_download.sh (both editions), plus
         service.sh (MLX edition);

     (b) the shell libraries - lib/common.sh, lib/preflight.sh and
         lib/fetch-model.sh (both editions), plus lib/build-fastmtp.sh (GGUF
         edition);

     (c) the Python programs - lib/chat.py, lib/dashboard.py,
         lib/diff_config.py and lib/tools-template.py;

     (d) the benchmark and verification tools under bench/;

     (e) env.conf and its comments;

     (f) the documentation - README.md and everything under docs/;

     (g) the model registry, the hardware recommendation rules, the memory and
         context arithmetic, the on-disk model picker, the author banner, and
         every other original part of the above, including any update, port or
         modification the Licensor releases.

   A file listed above is covered whether it appears in one edition or both.
   The two editions share most of their code, so a file present in both is the
   same covered material; where one edition has a file the other does not, that
   file is still covered here.

   3.2 EXCLUDED COMPONENTS (not covered by this License)

   The following are NOT covered by this License. They are the work of other
